<p>ब्रह्मणस्पतिः /brahmaṇaspatiḥ/ <a href='https://github.com/sanskrit/samskrtam.ru/blob/master/backup/sanskrit-lexicon/KEWA/src/img/2-456-01.jpg'>IMG</a> <a href='https://github.com/sanskrit/samskrtam.ru/blob/master/backup/sanskrit-lexicon/KEWA/src/img/2-456-01.jpg.txt'>Edit</a> </p><p><br><br>Bráhmanaspátiḥ, s.u. Býhaspátiḥ.</p>

ब्राह्मणः, ब्राह्मणम्
<p>ब्राह्मणः, ब्राह्मणम् /brāhmaṇaḥ/ /brāhmaṇam/ <a href='https://github.com/sanskrit/samskrtam.ru/blob/master/backup/sanskrit-lexicon/KEWA/src/img/2-456-02.jpg'>IMG</a> <a href='https://github.com/sanskrit/samskrtam.ru/blob/master/backup/sanskrit-lexicon/KEWA/src/img/2-456-02.jpg.txt'>Edit</a> </p><p><br><br>brāhmaṇáḥ, brahmaṇam, s. bráhma.</p>

