रोकम्
<p>रोकम् /rokam/ <a href='https://github.com/sanskrit/samskrtam.ru/blob/master/backup/sanskrit-lexicon/KEWA/src/img/3-075-01.jpg'>IMG</a> <a href='https://github.com/sanskrit/samskrtam.ru/blob/master/backup/sanskrit-lexicon/KEWA/src/img/3-075-01.jpg.txt'>Edit</a> </p><p><br><br>rokam n. Boot, Schiff / boat, ship (Lex.); vgl. kõlami<br>rūk 'Boot' (aus dem Indoar. telugu rõkamu 'Schiff). Emeneau, Kolami, A Dravidian Language (1955) 237.</p>

रोकः, रोकः
<p>रोकः, रोकः /rokaḥ/ /rokaḥ/ <a href='https://github.com/sanskrit/samskrtam.ru/blob/master/backup/sanskrit-lexicon/KEWA/src/img/3-075-02.jpg'>IMG</a> <a href='https://github.com/sanskrit/samskrtam.ru/blob/master/backup/sanskrit-lexicon/KEWA/src/img/3-075-02.jpg.txt'>Edit</a> </p><p><br><br>rókaḥ, rokaḥ, s. rócate.</p>

