<p>वरेणः, वरोलः /vareṇaḥ/ /varolaḥ/ <a href='https://github.com/sanskrit/samskrtam.ru/blob/master/backup/sanskrit-lexicon/KEWA/src/img/3-153-02.jpg'>IMG</a> <a href='https://github.com/sanskrit/samskrtam.ru/blob/master/backup/sanskrit-lexicon/KEWA/src/img/3-153-02.jpg.txt'>Edit</a> </p><p><br><br>varenaḥ, varolah, s. varaṭi.</p>

